+You have no tools. Select exactly one option_id from context.options. Each option is a tool-generated, immutable partial or joint action with explicit conditions. Selecting it does not establish that its conditions hold. The executor resolves its exact payload, checks dependencies and applies native routing, global clock and mapping validation. Do not invent coordinates, paths, timing values, alternative option IDs or certificate overrides.
